# Lockout through the login route: the fifth failed check locks the account for 15 minutes, a successful login resets the
# count, and a locked account answers the uniform 401 (never 429, the lockout is not observable). Disposable mechanic only.

@AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress = {{$processEnv AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}
@WebUI_Origin = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_WEBUI_ORIGIN}}
@AdminEmail = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_EMAIL}}
@AdminPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_PASSWORD}}
@TestPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_PASSWORD}}
@TestWrongPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_WRONG_PASSWORD}}
@RunId = {{$timestamp}}
@LoginLockoutEmail = credential.lockout.login.{{RunId}}@example.test


### [Setup][Lockout] Clear any session cookie left by a previous file (204 or 401, not asserted)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

###

### [Setup][Lockout] Login as admin (200 expected)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{AdminEmail}}", "password": "{{AdminPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-arsm-csrf-token='))?.match(/^__Host-arsm-csrf-token=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Setup][Lockout] Register the disposable mechanic that gets locked out (200 expected)
# @name loginLockoutMechanic
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Login", "lastName": "Lockout", "email": "{{LoginLockoutEmail}}", "password": "{{TestPassword}}", "personType": "Mechanic", "specialization": "GasolineAndDiesel", "expertise": ["Engine"] }

?? status == 200

###

### [Negative][Lockout] Four wrong passwords in a row are refused one by one (401 expected each)
# @no-cookie-jar
# @loop for 4
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{LoginLockoutEmail}}", "password": "{{TestWrongPassword}}" }

?? status == 401
?? js response.parsedBody.title == invalid_credentials

###

### [Positive][Lockout] The right password still works after four failures, and that resets the count (200 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{LoginLockoutEmail}}", "password": "{{TestPassword}}" }

?? status == 200
?? js (response.parsedBody.personId == loginLockoutMechanic.personId) == true

###

### [Negative][Lockout] Four more wrong passwords stay below the threshold because of the reset (401 expected each)
# @no-cookie-jar
# @loop for 4
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{LoginLockoutEmail}}", "password": "{{TestWrongPassword}}" }

?? status == 401
?? js response.parsedBody.title == invalid_credentials

###

### [Negative][Lockout] The fifth consecutive failure locks the account but still answers 401 (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{LoginLockoutEmail}}", "password": "{{TestWrongPassword}}" }

?? status == 401
?? js response.parsedBody.title == invalid_credentials

###

### [Negative][Lockout] Now even the right password is refused with the same uniform problem, never 429 (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{LoginLockoutEmail}}", "password": "{{TestPassword}}" }

?? status == 401
?? js response.parsedBody.title == invalid_credentials
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "Invalid login credentials.") == true
?? js (!response.headers['set-cookie']) == true

###

### [Cleanup][Lockout] Admin deletes the locked-out mechanic (200 expected, a lockout does not block the delete)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/admin/mechanics/{{loginLockoutMechanic.personId}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Setup][Lockout] Logout the admin session (204 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204
